* SPICE Netlist

VCC 3 0 DC 5V           ; V+ = 5V
VEE 2 0 DC -5V          ; V- = -5V

I0 2 10 DC 0.5mA        ; Current Source IO

R 6 3 1k                ; R (Assume 1k Ohm for example)
RC 9 3 1k               ; RC (Assume 1k Ohm for example)
RE1 4 2 1k              ; RE1 (Assume 1k Ohm for example)
RE2 5 2 1k              ; RE2 (Assume 1k Ohm for example)

Q1 6 1 10 npn           ; Q1
Q2 9 2 10 npn           ; Q2
Q3 5 4 11 npn           ; Q3
Q4 5 11 3 pnp           ; Q4

CE 4 2 10uF            ; CE (Assume 10uF for example)

